<title>PORTUGAL: PORTUGAL CABINET TO CONSIDER PT SALE.</title>
<headline>PORTUGAL CABINET TO CONSIDER PT SALE.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Portuguese cabinet will tomorrow discuss legislation covering the third stage privatisation of Portugal Telecom, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>The government has said it will sell 26 percent of the capital of PT in the final quarter of 1997.</p>
</text>
